      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Proud moment recap! On August 5th, a distinguished member of the Coast Guard, Lt. Blair Ogujiofor, threw out the first pitch at the @Nationals game in honor of Coast Guard Day. Lt. Ogujiofor is a Coast Guard pilot stationed in Corpus Christi, TX. Exemplifying the Coast Guard’s legacy as America’s maritime first responder, she and her helicopter crew were recently honored for their critical role in the Coast Guard’s response to the tragic floods in Central Texas. This event marked our enduring commitment to service and excellence. Thank you for celebrating with us! #uscg #Nationals #baseball @DHSgov",
      "text_resolved": "Proud moment recap! On August 5th, a distinguished member of the Coast Guard, Lt. Blair Ogujiofor, threw out the first pitch at the @Nationals game in honor of Coast Guard Day. Lt. Ogujiofor is a Coast Guard pilot stationed in Corpus Christi, TX. Exemplifying the Coast Guard’s legacy as America’s maritime first responder, she and her helicopter crew were recently honored for their critical role in the Coast Guard’s response to the tragic floods in Central Texas. This event marked our enduring commitment to service and excellence. Thank you for celebrating with us! #uscg #Nationals #baseball @DHSgov",
