      "text": "Bravo Zulu to the crew of U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Hamilton for seizing 4,133 pounds of cocaine during a recent interdiction!\n\nTheir vigilance and professionalism continue the Coast Guard’s operations to interdict, seize, and disrupt transshipment of cocaine and other bulk illicit drugs by sea. As America’s maritime counter-drug leader, we are using every capability at our disposal to stop drug trafficking and make our communities safer. #USCG #DrugInterdiction \n@USCGPACAREA @DHSgov",
