      "quoted_tweet_id": null,
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "A bold step forward for America and the U.S. Coast Guard.  \n\nOn August 10, we’ll commission the Storis (WAGB 21), our first polar icebreaker in 25+ years. This historic milestone strengthens U.S. Arctic presence, protects national security, and continues America’s leadership in the region.\n\nThe Storis is a game-changer for Arctic security, and will bolster the Coast Guard’s ability to control, secure, and defend the U.S. border around Alaska and maritime approaches in the Arctic.\n\nFollow us for updates & an inside look at this historic milestone! #uscg #forcedesign2028 #arctic \n@USCGArctic @DHSgov @Sec_Noem",
      "text_resolved": "A bold step forward for America and the U.S. Coast Guard.  \n\nOn August 10, we’ll commission the Storis (WAGB 21), our first polar icebreaker in 25+ years. This historic milestone strengthens U.S. Arctic presence, protects national security, and continues America’s leadership in the region.\n\nThe Storis is a game-changer for Arctic security, and will bolster the Coast Guard’s ability to control, secure, and defend the U.S. border around Alaska and maritime approaches in the Arctic.\n\nFollow us for updates & an inside look at this historic milestone! #uscg #forcedesign2028 #arctic \n@USCGArctic @DHSgov @Sec_Noem",
