      "text": "Sextant + Minotaur = a powerful combination for the Coast Guard! \n \nProject Minerva is integrating these systems to give commanders the clearest, fastest picture possible. These integrations are key to Coastal Sentinel and the future vision of Force Design 2028! As part of Coastal Sentinel and Force Design 2028, Minerva is accelerating our use of cutting-edge technology to achieve 100% operational control of the U.S. border and maritime approaches: https://t.co/NwO7ZceLP9\n\n#USCG #CoastalSentinel #ForceDesign2028 @DHSgov",
