      "text": "The U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Storis (WAGB 21) is officially commissioned! This medium polar icebreaker strengthens our capacity to protect U.S. sovereignty and enhance national and economic security in some of the world’s most challenging environments.  \n \nAs a key milestone in our Force Design 2028 transformation, Storis will continue our return on America’s historic investment in the Coast Guard. #uscg #ForceDesign2028 #arctic #nationalsecurity\n\n@Sec_Noem @DHSgov @USCGArctic @USCGPACAREA",
